'''Susan''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Community Center}}. To access her associated features, players must be at least {{Aqua|SkyBlock Level 10}}.

== Usage ==
Completion of '''Susan'''{{'}}s dialogue grants access to the {{Zone|Security Hall}}.

